---
import SolutionPage from '../../layouts/SolutionPage.astro';
---

<SolutionPage
  title="Brain Optimization: Cognitive Performance & Mental Sharpness"
  parent="Mind"
  oneliner="Brain fog, word-finding gaps, and focus problems are not inevitable aging — they are feedback. Act on them early."
  slug="cognitive"
  description="Brain optimization through methylated B-complex nutraceuticals and nootropic peptide protocols. My4MLife addresses cognitive performance, mental sharpness, focus and memory through the Mind pillar — OTC NeuroBridge or full Rx peptide consult."
>
  <!-- ── Why this matters ── -->
  <h2>Why This Matters</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Cognitive decline is reversible when caught early — the brain follows a ruthless use-it-or-lose-it principle</li>
    <li>Chronic sleep debt, untreated gut inflammation, and hormonal decline are silently degrading neural architecture right now</li>
    <li>Mind is the destination of the entire 4M framework — everything else feeds into cognitive output</li>
  </ul>

  <!-- ── Two Paths to Act ── -->
  <h2 class="section-eliminate">Two Paths to Act</h2>
  <div class="two-paths-grid">
    <div class="path-card path-otc">
      <div class="path-badge">OTC Nutraceutical</div>
      <h3>NeuroBridge</h3>
      <p class="path-price">Available at member pricing</p>
      <p>Foundational cognitive support OTC — methylated B-complex stack (B6 P-5-P, B12 methylcobalamin, 5-MTHF, B5, B1, B2 active forms). Supports neurotransmitter production and methylation without a prescription.</p>
      <a href="/membership" class="btn-sol primary">Join to unlock member pricing →</a>
    </div>
    <div class="path-card path-rx">
      <div class="path-badge path-badge-rx">Rx Protocol</div>
      <h3>Comprehensive 4M Consult</h3>
      <p class="path-price">Peptide protocols included</p>
      <p>For persistent cognitive issues — memory lapses, focus, word-finding — want the full peptide and lab review. Covers nootropic peptides (Semax, Selank, Cerebrolysin, BPC-157), hormone optimization, and your personalized 4M protocol.</p>
      <a href="/consult" class="btn-sol secondary">Schedule Rx Consult →</a>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── When to choose which ── -->
  <div class="when-strip">
    <div class="when-col">
      <div class="when-label">Choose OTC when:</div>
      <p>Occasional brain fog — want a foundational methylated B-complex stack to support neurotransmitter production without committing to a full protocol.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="when-divider"></div>
    <div class="when-col">
      <div class="when-label">Choose Rx when:</div>
      <p>Persistent cognitive issues — memory lapses, focus problems, word-finding gaps — want full peptide candidacy review and lab-guided protocol.</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Protégé footer card ── -->
  <div class="protege-card">
    <strong>Want the deeper protocol?</strong> The 4M Protégé program pairs your cognitive plan with the Connected Mind baseline assessment, daily Dual N-Back training, and ongoing coaching — all tracked in the My4MLife app. <a href="/consult">Learn about Protégé →</a>
  </div>

  <!-- ── Condensed Insulting Behaviors ── -->
  <h2>The Insulting Behaviors</h2>
  <ul class="insult-list">
    <li>Chronic poor sleep — the glymphatic system clears amyloid and metabolic waste during deep sleep only</li>
    <li>Untreated gut inflammation — the gut-brain axis directly modulates neuroinflammation</li>
    <li>No cognitive training — passive screen consumption makes no demands on the brain and drives atrophy</li>
    <li>Excess alcohol — even moderate chronic use accelerates hippocampal atrophy</li>
  </ul>

  <p><a href="/blog/eliminate-the-insulting-behavior-cognitive" class="read-more-link">Read more: Eliminate the Insulting Behavior — Cognitive →</a></p>
</SolutionPage>

<style>
.two-paths-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr));
  gap: 1.25rem;
  margin: 1.25rem 0;
}
.path-card {
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.5rem;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  gap: 0.5rem;
}
.path-card.path-rx {
  border-color: var(--primary);
  border-width: 2px;
}
.path-badge {
  display: inline-block;
  font-size: 0.7rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.1em;
  color: var(--accent);
  background: rgba(0,184,148,0.12);
  border: 1px solid rgba(0,184,148,0.35);
  padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
  border-radius: 999px;
  align-self: flex-start;
}
.path-badge.path-badge-rx {
  color: var(--primary);
  background: rgba(26,54,93,0.08);
  border-color: rgba(26,54,93,0.3);
}
.path-card h3 {
  font-family: 'Playfair Display', serif;
  font-size: 1.15rem;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin: 0;
}
.path-price {
  font-size: 0.82rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  color: var(--accent);
  margin: 0 !important;
}
.path-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; color: var(--text-light); margin: 0; }
.path-card .btn-sol { align-self: flex-start; margin-top: 0.5rem; }
.when-strip {
  display: flex;
  gap: 1.5rem;
  background: var(--bg-soft);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
  margin: 1rem 0 1.5rem;
}
@media (max-width: 560px) {
  .when-strip { flex-direction: column; }
  .when-divider { display: none; }
}
.when-col { flex: 1; }
.when-divider { width: 1px; background: var(--border); }
.when-label {
  font-size: 0.78rem;
  font-weight: 700;
  letter-spacing: 0.08em;
  color: var(--primary);
  margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
}
.when-col p { font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-light); margin: 0; }
.protege-card {
  background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(26,54,93,0.06) 0%, rgba(0,184,148,0.06) 100%);
  border: 1px solid var(--border);
  border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
  border-radius: var(--radius);
  padding: 1.1rem 1.4rem;
  font-size: 0.92rem;
  color: var(--text);
  margin: 0 0 2rem;
}
.protege-card a { color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
.protege-card a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
.read-more-link {
  display: inline-block;
  margin-top: 0.5rem;
  color: var(--accent);
  font-weight: 600;
  font-size: 0.9rem;
  text-decoration: none;
}
.read-more-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
